---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service — FreeFontFinderAI"
  description="Read the Terms of Service governing the use of FreeFontFinderAI, our optical font identification tools, and verified open-source typography resources."
  canonicalUrl="https://freefontfinderai.com/terms"
>
  <article class="py-12 sm:py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 max-w-[1000px] mx-auto transition-colors">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="mb-12">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white dark:bg-white/[0.03] border border-[#e2e4e8] dark:border-[#23252a] font-mono text-[11px] text-[#475569] dark:text-[#8a8f98] mb-4 shadow-sm">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#ff4d00] dark:bg-[#e4f222]"></span>
        <span>TERMS & OPEN TYPOGRAPHY CONDITIONS</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-[510] text-[#08090a] dark:text-[#ffffff] tracking-[-0.022em]">
        Terms of Service
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-[15px] sm:text-[16px] text-[#475569] dark:text-[#8a8f98] leading-relaxed">
        Last revised: September 2026. Please read these terms carefully before using FreeFontFinderAI.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <div class="space-y-8 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-[#475569] dark:text-[#8a8f98]">
      
      <!-- Section 1 -->
      <section class="rounded-[14px] border border-[#e2e4e8] dark:border-[#23252a] bg-white dark:bg-[#0f1011] p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm">
        <div class="border-l-2 border-[#ff4d00] dark:border-[#e4f222] pl-3.5 mb-3">
          <h2 class="text-[17px] sm:text-[18px] font-[510] text-[#08090a] dark:text-[#ffffff] tracking-[-0.012em]">
            1. Acceptance of Terms
          </h2>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[#334155] dark:text-[#d0d6e0]">
          By accessing and utilizing FreeFontFinderAI (the "Website" or "Service"), you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agreed to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree with any portion of these terms, you should discontinue use of the website immediately.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 2 -->
      <section class="rounded-[14px] border border-[#e2e4e8] dark:border-[#23252a] bg-white dark:bg-[#0f1011] p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm">
        <div class="border-l-2 border-[#ff4d00] dark:border-[#e4f222] pl-3.5 mb-3">
          <h2 class="text-[17px] sm:text-[18px] font-[510] text-[#08090a] dark:text-[#ffffff] tracking-[-0.012em]">
            2. Permitted Use and Service Scope
          </h2>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[#334155] dark:text-[#d0d6e0]">
          FreeFontFinderAI is provided as a free utility to assist graphic designers, web developers, content creators, and the general public in recognizing letterforms and discovering matching open-source typefaces. You agree to use the service only for lawful purposes and in accordance with these terms.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 list-disc pl-5 mt-3.5 text-[#334155] dark:text-[#d0d6e0]">
          <li>You may not use automated scraping bots or denial-of-service techniques that overwhelm or disrupt our hosting infrastructure.</li>
          <li>You may not attempt to reverse-engineer or inject malicious code into client-side scripts.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 3 -->
      <section class="rounded-[14px] border border-[#e2e4e8] dark:border-[#23252a] bg-white dark:bg-[#0f1011] p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm">
        <div class="border-l-2 border-[#ff4d00] dark:border-[#e4f222] pl-3.5 mb-3">
          <h2 class="text-[17px] sm:text-[18px] font-[510] text-[#08090a] dark:text-[#ffffff] tracking-[-0.012em]">
            3. Font Licensing & Third-Party Intellectual Property
          </h2>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[#334155] dark:text-[#d0d6e0]">
          All fonts identified, previewed, or linked through FreeFontFinderAI are the intellectual property of their respective creators and copyright holders:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 list-disc pl-5 mt-3.5 text-[#334155] dark:text-[#d0d6e0]">
          <li><strong>Open-Source Licenses:</strong> The vast majority of our matched typefaces are published on Google Fonts under the <strong class="text-[#08090a] dark:text-[#ffffff]">SIL Open Font License (OFL)</strong> or Apache 2.0 License, permitting personal and commercial use.</li>
          <li><strong>User Responsibility:</strong> While we curate verified open-source typefaces, you are solely responsible for reviewing and adhering to the specific licensing terms of any font you choose to download or deploy into commercial production.</li>
          <li><strong>Trademarks:</strong> Typeface names, foundry marks, and brand trademarks mentioned on this site belong to their respective owners and are used purely for nominative and identification purposes.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 4 -->
      <section class="rounded-[14px] border border-[#e2e4e8] dark:border-[#23252a] bg-white dark:bg-[#0f1011] p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm">
        <div class="border-l-2 border-[#ff4d00] dark:border-[#e4f222] pl-3.5 mb-3">
          <h2 class="text-[17px] sm:text-[18px] font-[510] text-[#08090a] dark:text-[#ffffff] tracking-[-0.012em]">
            4. Disclaimer of Warranties
          </h2>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[#334155] dark:text-[#d0d6e0]">
          The Service is provided on an "AS IS" and "AS AVAILABLE" basis without warranties of any kind, whether express or implied. While our optical matching engine strives for high mathematical accuracy, we do not guarantee that every uploaded letterform or custom font will yield a 100% identical match.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 5 -->
      <section class="rounded-[14px] border border-[#e2e4e8] dark:border-[#23252a] bg-white dark:bg-[#0f1011] p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm">
        <div class="border-l-2 border-[#ff4d00] dark:border-[#e4f222] pl-3.5 mb-3">
          <h2 class="text-[17px] sm:text-[18px] font-[510] text-[#08090a] dark:text-[#ffffff] tracking-[-0.012em]">
            5. Limitation of Liability
          </h2>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[#334155] dark:text-[#d0d6e0]">
          In no event shall FreeFontFinderAI, its developers, or affiliates be held liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, or consequential damages resulting from the use or inability to use this website, font files, or CSS code snippets.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 6 -->
      <section class="rounded-[14px] border border-[#e2e4e8] dark:border-[#23252a] bg-white dark:bg-[#0f1011] p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm">
        <div class="border-l-2 border-[#ff4d00] dark:border-[#e4f222] pl-3.5 mb-3">
          <h2 class="text-[17px] sm:text-[18px] font-[510] text-[#08090a] dark:text-[#ffffff] tracking-[-0.012em]">
            6. Changes to These Terms
          </h2>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[#334155] dark:text-[#d0d6e0]">
          We reserve the right to revise or replace these Terms of Service at any time. Continued use of the website following any posted modifications constitutes acceptance of the new terms.
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
